recommend keep-going the queue now names run_in_forbear at 10 rungs by 137 lines, 1,233 carried, with weigh_the_standing at 22 by 57 behind it -- take weigh_the_standing first, since ten rungs paying a hundred and thirty-seven lines each spread a widening very little while twenty-two rungs spread it twice as far, and the standing cluster around it (date_the_standing at 22 by 56, herald_the_standing at 22 by 53, carry_the_position at 22 by 50) is plainly one cohort the reach reading will lift together; hash the family before trusting the count, walk the reach to closure rather than one hop, and hold the rung list before the harness grows.
